# The smallest number of the format not below |x|: what a radius computation needs of a center.
kernel:        abs_upper_2
input:         x = x0 x1
output:        t
value:         abs(x)
requires:      normalized x
ensures:       rounded t up
source:        abs_2, then to_up_2 (Milestone 1 listing)
status:        unverified
cone_exempt:   through abs_2 and to_up_2, which select and step to a neighbor; the non-finite layer tests x0 itself

(a0, a1) = abs_2(x0, x1)
t        = to_up_2(a0, a1)
